
### 1. POST - Tambah tugas baru
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Menyelesaikan laporan praktikum React",
  "course": "Pemrograman Web",
  "deadline": "2026-12-01",
  "priority": "Tinggi"
}

### 2. POST - Menguji tugas duplikat (ConflictException)
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Menyelesaikan laporan praktikum React",
  "course": "Pemrograman Web",
  "deadline": "2026-12-01",
  "priority": "Tinggi"
}

### 3. GET - Menampilkan seluruh tugas
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### 4. GET - Menampilkan tugas berdasarkan ID
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/1

### 5. PATCH - Mengubah status tugas
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Sedang dikerjakan",
  "priority": "Sedang"
}

### 6. GET - Memeriksa hasil perubahan
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/1

### 7. DELETE - Menghapus tugas
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/1

### 8. GET - Memastikan tugas sudah terhapus
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### 9. GET - Menguji NotFoundException
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/999

### 10. POST - Menguji validasi DTO
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AB",
  "course": "Pemrograman Web",
  "deadline": "2026-12-01",
  "priority": "Tinggi"
}

### POST - Menguji validasi DTO
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AB",
